@@ -0,0 +1,128 @@
+<!doctype html>
+<html lang="en">
+  <head>
+    <meta charset="utf-8" />
+    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
+    <title>Install · ForkMesh</title>
+    <meta
+      name="description"
+      content="Install the ForkMesh desktop node that keeps Git mirrors locally and serves repository browsing through the mainnode relay."
+    />
+    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css" />
+    <script src="static-page.js" defer></script>
+  </head>
+  <body>
+    <header class="site-header">
+      <div class="header-inner">
+        <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="ForkMesh home">
+          <img class="brand-mark" src="/assets/logo.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
+          <span>ForkMesh</span>
+        </a>
+        <nav class="global-nav" aria-label="Global">
+          <a href="/#catalog">Repositories</a>
+          <a href="/network/">Network</a>
+          <a href="/docs/">Docs</a>
+          <a href="/#roomchat">Chat</a>
+        </nav>
+        <div class="header-actions">
+          <button id="theme-toggle" class="icon-button" type="button" aria-label="Toggle theme">
+            <svg class="moon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 12.8A8.5 8.5 0 1 1 11.2 3 6.7 6.7 0 0 0 21 12.8Z"></path></svg>
+            <svg class="sun" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"></circle><path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.93 4.93l1.42 1.42M17.65 17.65l1.42 1.42M2 12h2M20 12h2M4.93 19.07l1.42-1.42M17.65 6.35l1.42-1.42"></path></svg>
+          </button>
+          <a class="install-link" href="/install" aria-current="page">Install</a>
+        </div>
+      </div>
+    </header>
+
+    <main class="page-shell docs-layout install-page">
+      <aside class="docs-sidebar" aria-label="Install sections">
+        <nav class="docs-nav">
+          <h2>Install</h2>
+          <a href="#command">Command</a>
+          <a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a>
+          <a href="#requirements">Requirements</a>
+          <a href="#overrides">Overrides</a>
+        </nav>
+      </aside>
+
+      <article class="docs-content">
+        <section class="doc-section page-hero compact-hero" aria-labelledby="install-title">
+          <p class="eyebrow">Desktop node</p>
+          <h1 id="install-title">Install the ForkMesh desktop node</h1>
+          <p class="hero-copy">
+            Run a local-first source-code host that keeps your Git mirrors on your machine while the ForkMesh mainnode coordinates discovery, relay, and routing.
+          </p>
+        </section>
+
+        <section id="command" class="doc-section panel doc-panel">
+          <div class="panel-header">
+            <div>
+              <h2>One-line install</h2>
+              <p>Fetch the installer, build the Qt desktop client, and place the binary in your local bin directory.</p>
+            </div>
+          </div>
+          <div class="doc-body install-command-body">
+            <code id="install-cmd">curl -fsSL https://forkmesh.com/install.sh | bash</code>
+            <button id="install-copy" class="copy-button" type="button">Copy</button>
+          </div>
+        </section>
+
+        <section id="how-it-works" class="doc-section panel doc-panel">
+          <div class="panel-header">
+            <div>
+              <h2>How the desktop client helps</h2>
+              <p>ForkMesh separates the control plane from the Git data plane.</p>
+            </div>
+          </div>
+          <div class="doc-body">
+            <p>The desktop app keeps a local Git mirror for the projects you host. The mainnode and Cloudflare Worker are not canonical Git storage; the Worker only coordinates discovery, relay, and routing.</p>
+            <p>When someone opens a repository, code/file browsing and clone data are served live from your desktop node through an outbound host tunnel. The public catalog can point people to the project, but the repository contents still originate from the host's local mirror.</p>
+            <p>This model helps preserve projects without forcing every maintainer into a single central forge or long-term central canonical Git storage.</p>
+          </div>
+        </section>
+
+        <section id="requirements" class="doc-section panel doc-panel">
+          <div class="panel-header">
+            <div>
+              <h2>Requirements</h2>
+              <p>The installer can install missing packages on common systems when a supported package manager is available.</p>
+            </div>
+          </div>
+          <div class="doc-body">
+            <ul class="doc-list">
+              <li>Git, CMake, and a C++ compiler.</li>
+              <li>Qt 6 with Widgets, Network, and Svg components.</li>
+              <li>OpenSSL development libraries.</li>
+              <li>Linux package managers such as apt, dnf, yum, pacman, zypper, or apk; macOS uses Homebrew plus Xcode Command Line Tools.</li>
+            </ul>
+          </div>
+        </section>
+
+        <section id="overrides" class="doc-section panel doc-panel">
+          <div class="panel-header">
+            <div>
+              <h2>Environment overrides</h2>
+              <p>Use these when self-hosting, changing install paths, or managing prerequisites yourself.</p>
+            </div>
+          </div>
+          <div class="doc-body">
+            <pre class="code-card"><code>curl -fsSL https://forkmesh.com/install.sh | FORKMESH_HOST=https://forkmesh.com bash
+curl -fsSL https://forkmesh.com/install.sh | FORKMESH_DIR=$HOME/src/forkmesh FORKMESH_BIN_DIR=$HOME/bin bash
+curl -fsSL https://forkmesh.com/install.sh | FORKMESH_NO_INSTALL_DEPS=1 bash</code></pre>
+            <ul class="doc-list">
+              <li><code>FORKMESH_HOST</code> changes the mainnode host used to clone source.</li>
+              <li><code>FORKMESH_NODE</code>, <code>FORKMESH_NAME</code>, or <code>FORKMESH_REPO</code> can point the installer at another published repo.</li>
+              <li><code>FORKMESH_DIR</code> changes the source checkout location.</li>
+              <li><code>FORKMESH_BIN_DIR</code> changes where the built <code>forkmesh</code> binary is installed.</li>
+              <li><code>FORKMESH_NO_INSTALL_DEPS=1</code> disables automatic dependency installation.</li>
+            </ul>
+            <div class="hero-actions">
+              <a class="primary-button" href="/#catalog">Browse repositories</a>
+              <a class="secondary-button" href="/docs/">Read docs</a>
+            </div>
+          </div>
+        </section>
+      </article>
+    </main>
+  </body>
+</html>
